---
/** Options for RAW preview extraction; the tool page and the /raw-to-jpg landing page share this copy. */
import OptionDetails from '../OptionDetails.astro';
---
<div class="field">
  <label class="check"><input type="checkbox" id="upright" /> Turn the picture upright when the camera marked it as rotated</label>
</div>
<OptionDetails>
  <p>This pulls out the JPEG preview the camera wrote into the RAW file, and saves its bytes unchanged. It does not develop the RAW: no exposure, white balance or noise changes are made. Turning a picture upright is the one exception, and it re-encodes the JPEG at quality 95.</p>
</OptionDetails>
